  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 802.06 “Excavator” means “excavator” as defined in RSA 374:48, IV, namely, “any person performing an excavation.”\n\nSource. #7350, eff 8-23-00; ss by #9226, INTERIM, eff 8-16-08; ss and moved by #9318, eff 11-8-08 (from Puc 802.05); ss by #12102, eff 2-8-17",
